# The context router IS tracked. A hook that decides what leaves this machine
# is a security control, and the rule here is that security controls are
# written down, reviewed and tested -- an untracked one is the "trust me" that
# TP-161 spent a day deleting. What it produces at runtime is not tracked:
# summaries derived from source, and a state file with quota counters.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/context/
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/scripts/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/tests/
.claude/cache/
.claude/.state/
apps/web/AGENTS.md
apps/web/CLAUDE.md
